{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brass &amp; Bramble</strong> is a narrative deck-builder set in an alternate steampunk Victorian age where myth and empire collide. Step into the role of Avalon\u2019s Envoy, wielding your deck to battle the British Empire\u2019s brass-forged legions across the globe, grow your bonds with mythological legends, and rebuild Avalon as your home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, choose your companions, and decide the future of Avalon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/eb0a4e6d8d4d164555d233fe8de55552.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical card combat interwoven with story encounters. Experience an epic handcrafted story while uncovering unique personal arcs for each Legend you rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.poster.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.webm?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.mp4?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/642b24f4d72acd6632a56716f9953535.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit 15 mythical Legends from around the world. Each brings distinct abilities, cards, building upgrades, and relics that expand as your bond deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/a92df77043e739040f045a7b77b75072.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1120 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/1361cf73fe4ef085eff5aed445bb77a8.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select up to three Legends to join you on each expedition. Explore the forests of Ireland to the deserts of Egypt to the jungles of India and many more, facing enemies, gathering relics, and rescuing new allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/dc84dee56271682cec83aae6aee78794.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two expeditions unfold the same. <i>Brass &amp; Bramble</i> follows an evolving story rather than a roguelike loop with a shifting pool of events, challenges, and discoveries that keeps every journey fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/827eff29e2b4f647a98a37387a62c259.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and refine cards through victories, story events, and Legend bonds. Craft strategies around synergies between companions, relics and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/65109acdba70eccec5f06125be1824c0.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore Avalon as your stronghold between expeditions. Upgrading it unlocks resources, features, and narrative choices that fuel your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.poster.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.webm?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.mp4?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039690?t=1760609468","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039690?t=1760609468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/e610529f37f59e9ea4db743ef7563a097cc67344/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760609468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/e610529f37f59e9ea4db743ef7563a097cc67344/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760609468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brass &amp; Bramble</strong> is a narrative deck-builder set in an alternate steampunk Victorian age where myth and empire collide. Step into the role of Avalon\u2019s Envoy, wielding your deck to battle the British Empire\u2019s brass-forged legions across the globe, grow your bonds with mythological legends, and rebuild Avalon as your home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, choose your companions, and decide the future of Avalon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/eb0a4e6d8d4d164555d233fe8de55552.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical card combat interwoven with story encounters. Experience an epic handcrafted story while uncovering unique personal arcs for each Legend you rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.poster.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.webm?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/55c8b66fa47c5ecd16b80b98a1e70e18.mp4?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/642b24f4d72acd6632a56716f9953535.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit 15 mythical Legends from around the world. Each brings distinct abilities, cards, building upgrades, and relics that expand as your bond deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/a92df77043e739040f045a7b77b75072.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1120 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/1361cf73fe4ef085eff5aed445bb77a8.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select up to three Legends to join you on each expedition. Explore the forests of Ireland to the deserts of Egypt to the jungles of India and many more, facing enemies, gathering relics, and rescuing new allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/dc84dee56271682cec83aae6aee78794.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two expeditions unfold the same. <i>Brass &amp; Bramble</i> follows an evolving story rather than a roguelike loop with a shifting pool of events, challenges, and discoveries that keeps every journey fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/827eff29e2b4f647a98a37387a62c259.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and refine cards through victories, story events, and Legend bonds. Craft strategies around synergies between companions, relics and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/65109acdba70eccec5f06125be1824c0.webp?t=1760609468\" width=376 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore Avalon as your stronghold between expeditions. Upgrading it unlocks resources, features, and narrative choices that fuel your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.poster.avif?t=1760609468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.webm?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/extras/ffebbb56919e2f130e5d20c46c1aab6e.mp4?t=1760609468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Puca Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039690/bc4c4dab07f542120d7f1bf61130db219e5af9d0/header.jpg?t=1760609468","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Brass & Bramble","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"